  "description": "Get ready to level up your lifestyle in the heart of Dublin's vibrant scene with these brand new apartments at Grand Canal Harbour, Dublin 8, at the Guinness Quarter, right by the James's Hospital Luas stop and buzzing Thomas Street. This isn't just any apartment – it's your ticket to a whole new way of living, where historic charm meets contemporary cool! Dublin 8 is one of only two postal districts to span the River Liffey. \r\n\r\nWorld Class designed buildings/apartments\r\n\r\nGreat connectivity – one can walk, cycle or get the Luas from here to any part of the city.\r\n\r\n Ready to dive into one of the coolest neighbourhoods in the world? Time Out Magazine has spoken, and Dublin 8 is where it's at! With an electrifying mix of history, culture, arts and endless adventures, this is the place to be for those seeking a taste of Dublin's vibrant soul. From whiskey distilleries to trendy coffee shops, historic landmarks, and beyond, there's something here for every taste and vibe.\r\n\r\n Stunning Views, Epic Vibes: Say hello to jaw-dropping views and Instagram-worthy interiors! Our finished apartment development at Grand Canal Harbour is all about spacious living and breathtaking panoramas. Imagine waking up to stunning cityscapes every day – that's the level of epic we're talking about!\r\n\r\n Amenities for Days: Get ready to live your best life with a lineup of on-site amenities at Grand Canal Harbour that'll make every day feel like a holiday! We're talking co-working spaces, hip cafes, a killer gym, yoga studio, cinema, and even a games room with a putting green! And when you need to unwind, kick back in one of our resident lounges – your ultimate chill zone awaits!\r\n\r\nFully pedestrianised: Features at the Grand Canal Harbour development include extensive landscaped areas, including roof terraces, which have been designed to enhance biodiversity – it’s a green oasis in the heart of the city with semi-open winter gardens to facilitate all year round and all weather use.\r\n\r\n Community Buzz, Your Way: Join a community that's all about good vibes and great times! With an on-site cafe, creche, and supermarket, you'll be living in a neighbourhood that's as convenient as it is cool. Get ready to make new friends, create unforgettable memories, and live your best life, all within walking distance of your front door!\r\n\r\n Green Living, Cool Living: Go green without sacrificing style! Grand Canal Harbour, Dublin 8 is all about sustainability, so you can feel good about living in a home that's as eco-friendly as it is chic. Embrace a lifestyle that's as conscious as it is cool and join us in making a positive impact on the world!\r\n\r\n Dublin Dreams Come True: Picture this – living right next to the legendary Guinness Storehouse, with Dublin's iconic landmarks as your backdrop. From historic castles to buzzing markets, Dublin 8 is the perfect mix of city living. \r\n\r\n Join the Movement: Be part of something big, something bold, something that's changing the game! This developer doesn't just build homes – they build communities. Get ready to be part of a tribe that's all about living life to the fullest and making every moment count! \r\n\r\nPrime Location, Endless Adventures: Step out of your front door and dive into the beating heart of Dublin! From world-class pubs and trendy eateries to cultural hotspots and boutique shops, everything you crave is just a stone's throw away. Live where the action is and let Dublin 8 become your playground for urban exploration! With Phoenix Park, Europe's largest city park, closeby, outdoor enthusiasts will find their paradise for walks, cycles, and maybe even a deer sighting or two! \r\n\r\nOld Charm, New Culture: Dublin 8 blends old-world charm with a hipster flair, boasting winding streets, antique shops, and hidden gems waiting to be discovered. It's a place where tradition meets innovation, offering something new around every corner.\r\n\r\nPlease note Hooke & MacDonald are the Letting Agents for this Development.",
